# a build that asks for causes notes where the value is made that a test of a guard looks at: the entry of `area` for the guard itself, and the entry of the caller for the tests that stand in front of the copy in `unknownCaller`. The guards report shows that place
# OPTIONS: report=Flow
# RUN: notes f1:ParameterGuard mechanisms=all
# CHECK: notes of f1:ParameterGuard
# CHECK-NEXT: TestThatLeaves @34 in f1 layout=L0 from=EntryOfFunction made=@34 in f1 cause=UnprovenEntryValue
# CHECK-NEXT: TestThatLeaves @34 in f1 from=EntryOfFunction made=@34 in f1 cause=UnprovenEntryValue
# RUN(COPIED): notes f3 mechanisms=all
# COPIED: notes of f3:Body
# COPIED: TestThatLeaves @34 in f1 layout=L0 from=EntryOfFunction made=@276 in f3 cause=UnprovenEntryValue
# COPIED-NEXT: TestThatLeaves @34 in f1 from=EntryOfFunction made=@276 in f3 cause=UnprovenEntryValue
# PROGRAM-OF: tests-of-a-guard-are-notes-of-tests-that-leave.ir
